    "machine_start_gcode": "M190 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[0]} ; set bed temperature and wait\nT0\nM213 U0.01 ;undercut 0.10mm\n\nM82 ;absolute extrusion mode\nM104 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; set nozzle temperature\nM109 S{first_layer_temperature[0]} ; wait for nozzle temperature\nG280 S1\nG0 Z20\nG1 E-6.5 F2700 ; retract like Cura to prevent ooze\n;--- Light Purge / Wipe ---\nG1 Z{(first_layer_height + 0.15)} F3000\nG1 X10.1 Y20 Z{(first_layer_height + 0.15)} F5000.0\nG1 F1800 E0 ; prime back the 6.5 mm retraction (restores pressure)\nG1 X10.1 Y200.0 Z{(first_layer_height + 0.15)} F1500.0 E5 ; light extra purge\nG1 X10.4 Y200.0 Z{(first_layer_height + 0.15)} F5000.0\nG1 X10.4 Y20 Z{(first_layer_height + 0.15)} F1500.0 E5.5 ; light extra purge back\nG92 E0\nG0 X15 Y20 Z2.0 F9000 ; break away immediately to prevent blobbing",
    "machine_end_gcode": "G1 E-6.5 F2700 ; quick retraction to prevent ooze\n\nG91\nG0 Z10 F3000\nG90\nM140 S0\nM204 S3000\nM215 X1000000000 Y1000000000\nM107\nM82 ;absolute extrusion mode\nM104 S0\nM104 T1 S0\n;End of Gcode"
